    {
        "title": "grammar",
        "description": "<h3>There + to be в трёх временах</h3>\n<p><b>There is / there are</b> говорят, что что-то <b>есть</b> или <b>находится</b> где-то. По-русски вместо there ничего нет: There is a spider on my desk. — На моём столе (есть) паук.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Past:</b> There <b>was</b> / <b>were</b> · There <b>wasn't</b> / <b>weren't</b> · <b>Was / Were</b> there…? · Yes, there was. / No, there wasn't.</li>\n<li><b>Present:</b> There <b>is</b> / <b>are</b> · There <b>isn't</b> / <b>aren't</b> · <b>Is / Are</b> there…? · Yes, there is. / No, there isn't.</li>\n<li><b>Future:</b> There <b>will be</b> · There <b>won't be</b> · <b>Will</b> there <b>be</b>…? · Yes, there will. / No, there won't.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Запомни</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>is/was — с единственным числом и неисчисляемыми; are/were — с множественным: There <b>is</b> a pharmacy… / There <b>are</b> seven days…</li>\n<li>В будущем форма одна для всех: There <b>will be</b> a break / There <b>will be</b> snacks.</li>\n<li>В вопросах there идёт после глагола: <b>Is there</b>…? <b>Were there</b>…? <b>Will there be</b>…?</li>\n</ul>",
        "items": [
            {
                "id": 39,
                "original": "There <b>is</b> a pharmacy nearby.",
                "translate": "Рядом есть аптека. (there is — Present, ед. ч.)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 40,
                "original": "There <b>are</b> seven days in a week.",
                "translate": "В неделе семь дней. (there are — Present, мн. ч.)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 41,
                "original": "There <b>isn't</b> any money in my wallet!",
                "translate": "В моём кошельке нет денег! (there isn't)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 42,
                "original": "There <b>aren't</b> any painkillers in the house.",
                "translate": "В доме нет обезболивающих. (there aren't)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 43,
                "original": "<b>Is there</b> anything interesting on TV? – No, <b>there isn't</b>.",
                "translate": "Есть что-нибудь интересное по телевизору? – Нет. (Is there…? / No, there isn't)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 44,
                "original": "<b>Are there</b> any eggs in the fridge? – Yes, <b>there are</b> a few.",
                "translate": "В холодильнике есть яйца? – Да, несколько есть. (Are there…? / Yes, there are)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 45,
                "original": "How many people <b>are there</b> in the waiting room?",
                "translate": "Сколько человек в комнате ожидания? (How many… are there)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 46,
                "original": "There <b>was</b> an accident in the city centre yesterday.",
                "translate": "Вчера в центре города была авария. (there was — Past)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 47,
                "original": "There <b>were</b> a lot of people at the doctor's.",
                "translate": "У врача было много людей. (there were — Past, мн. ч.)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 48,
                "original": "There <b>wasn't</b> any fresh bread in the shop.",
                "translate": "В магазине не было свежего хлеба. (there wasn't)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 49,
                "original": "There <b>weren't</b> many tourists last winter.",
                "translate": "Прошлой зимой было не так много туристов. (there weren't)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 50,
                "original": "<b>Were there</b> any important letters for me? – No, <b>there weren't</b>.",
                "translate": "Были для меня важные письма? – Нет. (Were there…? / No, there weren't)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 51,
                "original": "<b>Was there</b> enough time to finish it? – Yes, <b>there was</b>.",
                "translate": "Было достаточно времени, чтобы закончить? – Да. (Was there…? / Yes, there was)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 52,
                "original": "I think <b>there will be</b> a thunderstorm tomorrow.",
                "translate": "Думаю, завтра будет гроза. (there will be — Future)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 53,
                "original": "<b>There'll be</b> a break soon, but <b>there won't be</b> any snacks.",
                "translate": "Скоро будет перерыв, но перекусить ничего не будет. (there'll be / there won't be)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 54,
                "original": "We have to do it now because <b>there won't be</b> time tomorrow.",
                "translate": "Нам нужно сделать это сейчас, потому что завтра не будет времени. (there won't be)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 55,
                "original": "<b>Will there be</b> a meeting next Friday? – Of course, <b>there will</b>.",
                "translate": "В следующую пятницу будет собрание? – Конечно, будет. (Will there be…? / there will)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 56,
                "original": "<b>Will there be</b> a doctor on duty at night? – No, <b>there won't</b>.",
                "translate": "Ночью будет дежурный врач? – Нет. (Will there be…? / No, there won't)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 57,
                "original": "There <b>was</b> a rash on his arm, but now <b>there isn't</b>.",
                "translate": "У него на руке была сыпь, а теперь нет. (there was / there isn't)",
                "isActive": true
            },
            {
                "id": 58,
                "original": "There <b>were</b> two patients yesterday, there <b>are</b> five today, and there <b>will be</b> more tomorrow.",
                "translate": "Вчера было два пациента, сегодня пять, а завтра будет больше. (was/were · is/are · will be)",
                "isActive": true
            }
        ]
    }
